 "text": "Hey, good to have you back. How are you? The basics are easy. Keep food in locked box and only bring food out of it at campsite with a haft. Try to camp in an open spot you can see from the tent. Bears are wary and won't expect you to know they' there. Stop eating, stand up and start packing, and don't look it in the face. It' usually leave. If it comes back twice, finds you' packed all the berries, it needs more than you do. Good. The tough part is being smarter than the bears, not being equipped. Most urban crowd never sees one, so they guess everything wants a fight.",
